{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794255935411,"sessionID":"ses_e3e0b2786ffein4CQhbx5fjWsf","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_016YsQFeQCYinmZ6J26Q9Nfi","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rm -rf .tmp backend/__pycache__ && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Table reservations\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,me}`, `/api/reservations[/<id>]`, `/api/availability?date=`, `/api/admin/reservations?date=&page=&page_size=`.\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `POST /api/auth/login`. The `admin` account's password comes from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup; unset/empty disables admin sign-in.\n- Each slot (date + time) seats at most 20 guests; overbooking answers 409 with an `error` message.\n- Data: SQLite at `./data/app.db`.\n- Frontend: React + Tailwind CSS (`npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`).\nEOF\ngit status --short"},"output":" M .dockerignore\n M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/AdminPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/AuthPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/AvailabilityPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/MyReservations.tsx\n?? frontend/src/ReservationForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/src/ui.tsx\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n","metadata":{"output":" M .dockerignore\n M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/AdminPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/AuthPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/AvailabilityPanel.tsx\n?? frontend/src/MyReservations.tsx\n?? frontend/src/ReservationForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/src/ui.tsx\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rm -rf .tmp backend/__pycache__ && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Table reservations\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,me}`, `/api/reservations[/<id>]`, `/api/availability?date=`, `/api/admin/reservations?date=&page=&page_size=`.\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `POST /api/auth/login`. The `admin` account's password comes from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup; unset/empty disables admin sign-in.\n- Each slot (date + time) seats at most 20 guests; overbooking answers 409 with an `error` message.\n- Data: SQLite at `./data/app.db`.\n- Frontend: React + Tailwind CSS (`npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`).\nEOF\ngit status --short","time":{"start":1794255935375,"end":1794255935394}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1fcd7890014PP28bcKhrPzaH","sessionID":"ses_e3e0b2786ffein4CQhbx5fjWsf","messageID":"msg_1c1fcb1d7001z7G8T2MQAqHE88"}}
